    "dom/login/login-recorded-flow.txt and login-dom.html",
    "dom/home/home-recorded-flow.txt and home-dom.html",
    "dom/signup/signup-recorded-flow.txt and signup-dom.html",
    "dom/forgot-password/forgot-password-recorded-flow.txt and the Forgot / Reset Password DOM snapshots",
